						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="benefits-blocks__text">
						<p>
							Trust us to give you total confidence in your most essential building materials. Density, moisture, strength, durability, particle distribution - these characteristics impact every aspect of your project’s success. </p><p>We’ve spent 65 years perfecting the basics so you can evaluate, excavate, drill, pour, pave and build your legacy with confidence.
						</p>
					</div><a class="btn btn-orange mr-3 mb-2" href="/services/materials-testing/soil-gravel/" role="button"><i class="fas fa-angle-right u-btn-fa"></i>SOIL & GRAVEL</a><a class="btn btn-orange" href="/services/materials-testing/aggregate/" role="button"><i class="fas fa-angle-right u-btn-fa"></i>AGGREGATES</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<hr>
		</div><!-- End Feature 1 -->
