							<div class="row" style="display: inline-block;">
								<h3 class="benefits-blocks__heading">ASPHALT & BITUMEN</h3>
								<p class="benefits-blocks__sub-heading">MIX CONTENT, QUALITY & RIDEABILITY</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="benefits-blocks__text">
							<p>
								You need a laboratory partner that can maintain excellent turnaround times, no matter the circumstances. </p>
							<p>
								Get meaningful insights at every level and stage of your work, from the particle size, stability, flow, density and void content of your samples to the roughness, rideability, deflection response and environmental resilience of your pavements layers.
							</p>
						</div><a class="btn btn-orange mr-3" href="/services/materials-testing/asphalt-bitumen/" role="button"><i class="fas fa-angle-right u-btn-fa"></i>ASPHALT & BITUMEN</a>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
